Title: "Edition"
Id: "2ee5d313-0409-4549-b1c1-ab7c06b109e8"

Text: "`edition:` records edition information.

```mlg-fragment
Resource:
. edition: \"Second edition\"
```

The value is `OpenText`: it must be quoted in source, the enclosing quotes are stripped. Ordinary quoted text decodes escaped double
quotes while preserving other backslashes; triple-quoted text is literal. Resource cards in `mlg view` use `title:` as the visible title and make it a hyperlink when `url:` is present."
Id: "3e55e490-08ce-48cf-bd58-144faadffcbc"
